{"body":{"says":"The grade given to something said. The author's practice, which he calls using measures: when something is said it is given a measure, such as that it is not yet owned by the build structure, and a value, and graded, so that what matters is not forgotten and its words stay as they were said. A measure need not be concluded: it is there to reason with, so that a session can say what is to be read and what is not."},"id":"01M6W3V08ESHZH4GN614H6XRAG","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"as":{"says":"What it is measured by: marked, as a reader marks a book; complementary, adding to what the briefs hold; or verbatim.","shape":"string"},"by":{"holds":false,"says":"The voice that measured it.","shape":"ref"},"note":{"optional":true,"says":"Why it was marked, in a few words: a note in the margin, written with curiosity rather than as one who knows what is good.","shape":"string"},"of":{"holds":false,"says":"What was said that is measured: a whole, as a session, an utterance, a paragraph or a sentence; with a range, the whole the run lies within.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"owned":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The brief that already holds what was said, where the structure owns it; unsaid where nothing built owns it yet.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"range":{"optional":true,"says":"Where the mark falls on a run of the whole's parts rather than the whole: from the first part to the last, in the whole's order.","shape":{"from":"ref","to":"ref"}},"thread":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The thread that takes it in, where one does.","shape":"ref"},"value":{"says":"Its grade: 3 not to be forgotten, 2 steers what is built, 1 noted. A scale for now, the author's to change.","shape":"number"}},"name":"measure","prev":"sha256-d4b64ce78361bfe9f4caa03f53d96e2d694e5b3c761414a5fed7c7d56fe08c0c"}
{"body":{"as":"complementary","by":{"$ref":"01M6W3V08EQCMC2KAJ7ATR5GBJ"},"note":"The measure he holds every primitive to: open-ended, in harmony with the others and with the system's values.","of":[{"$ref":"01M6SMY01NSVBMXFGC2AMM8TR9"}],"range":{"from":{"$ref":"01M6SMY0137PKT7J05C94BVXWX"},"to":{"$ref":"01M6SMY01MMEZZ6284V4H6DZSR"}},"value":3},"id":"01M6W4DK4PDDXG3AGPMZ8DDJWA","instance":["01M6W3V08ESHZH4GN614H6XRAG"],"kind":"version","prev":"sha256-1add105dafceb612b4871619c87ffe6f7686837a665c18ecb8c5fa742acf437b"}
